WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.406
Save a job, and let the app research it for you.

00:00:03.706 --> 00:00:07.012
Search inside the app. Describe the job you want.

00:00:07.312 --> 00:00:09.324
Or search the live web.

00:00:09.624 --> 00:00:13.332
Open any careers page. The robot button follows you.

00:00:13.632 --> 00:00:16.350
Tap it, then Fetch job.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:20.905
Saved. Salary, skills, and your match score.

00:00:21.205 --> 00:00:25.239
Next. It researches the company, and writes your cover letter.

